    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\ntox:A80B38EE41CA318C529E497CE0D2E40C1853E0592025D7872D6D96D751FBB60367F94CCB8747\n\n### qTox Version\n\nv1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\nb7802b42dcf5f68474eb4d6db66c004e3ca50848\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n0.2.20\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.8.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n I've noticed that using Tox doesn't allow file transfers within a group, but only within a single chat. Is it possible to implement this to allow file transfers to all chats in the group?\n\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\n I've noticed that using Tox doesn't allow file transfers within a group, but only within a single chat. Is it possible to implement this to allow file transfers to all chats in the group?\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n I've noticed that using Tox doesn't allow file transfers within a group, but only within a single chat. Is it possible to implement this to allow file transfers to all chats in the group?\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nUnable to reproduce\n\n### Operating System\n\nOther (please specify)\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nWindows 11 Version 25H2\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
